{"id":786548,"title":"16｜FastGPT介绍","content":"知识库是为了解决通用大模型无法回答私有或特定领域问题而设计的。例如，ChatGPT基于公开数据训练，能回答通用问题如“腾讯老总是谁”，但无法回答关于公司内部信息的问题。发色gpt作为一款效果优秀的知识库产品，支持SaaS模式和本地部署，适用于不同规模的企业。使用发色gpt创建知识库分为三步：首先上传业务文档至平台，自动转化为向量数据库；其次创建应用并关联所需的知识库；最后通过聊天入口与集成个性化知识的大模型交互。演示中，讲师创建了一个不含特定知识库的应用来展示其局限性，接着创建了包含网络梗的知识库，以解决大模型对最新流行语缺乏理解的问题。通过对比，展示了添加知识库后，系统能够更准确地响应特定领域的查询。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397483,"user_name":"Geek_14dffc","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3965751,"ip_address":"重庆","ucode":"989F9B2D3E5887","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738734529,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"我想问一下，chat的sessionId是怎么上下文串连的，是前端workFlow里面控制的么？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":395478,"user_name":"Geek_fbd57a","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4033181,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"6EC563015177DD","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1730938902,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"资料在哪里下载啊","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":4033181,"avatar":"","nickname":"Geek_fbd57a","note":"","ucode":"6EC563015177DD","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":655616,"discussion_content":"有人回答吗？ 收了钱没人理啊\n","content_length":15,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1735379157,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":4033181,"avatar":"","nickname":"Geek_fbd57a","note":"","ucode":"6EC563015177DD","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,